<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-4">
  <div class="col-8 offset-2">
    <h3>Privacy Policy</h3>
    <p class="text-muted"><small>Last updated: March 2026</small></p>
    <hr />

    <h5>Information we collect</h5>
    <p>
      When you sign up on Wanderlust, we collect your username and email
      address. When you create a listing, we collect details such as title,
      description, location, price, and images. When you make a booking, we
      collect check-in and check-out dates, number of guests, and payment
      details.
    </p>

    <h5>How we use your information</h5>
    <p>
      We use your information to provide and improve our services — including
      showing your listings to other users, processing bookings, and sending
      booking confirmations. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.
    </p>

    <h5>Images</h5>
    <p>
      Images you upload are stored securely on Cloudinary. By uploading an
      image, you confirm you have the rights to use it.
    </p>

    <h5>Cookies</h5>
    <p>
      Wanderlust uses session cookies to keep you logged in. These cookies are
      essential for the app to function and are not used for tracking or
      advertising.
    </p>

    <h5>Your rights</h5>
    <p>
      You can delete your listings and bookings at any time from your account.
      If you wish to delete your account or request your data, please contact
      us.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
